If you have HP for the "acid stomach", black puddings make mighty fine
eating. Of course, with random polymorphs, it may be risky taking one
on...
You can also quaff from sinks (again, carries its own risks) for an
eventual polymorph if you find yourself in an unfavourable form.

> 3. Tinker with my crystal ball on Sokoban (previously a (0:0) magic
