> scroll of genocide for tengus.

Can't you just write "remove curse" instead? Even if you revgen up a
half dozen tengus, there's still no guarantee of getting teleport
control from them- they don't always leave corpses, and the corpses
don't always grant control. teleportitis on its own is manageable.
it's the polymorphitis that's your main concern.

> But with polymorphitis, tinkering will be *damn hard*,
