enlightenment+levitation or acid+appropriate gem for the potion you
need,

> and I'm not sure if the resulting marker will have enough charges for
> a scroll of genocide.

Genocides are surprisingly cheap when it comes to marker charges. .
However if the Crystal ball is 0:0 you may find that the marker is
too, so unless you happen to have a means of charging on you, you
could be screwed there.

> 4. Fountain quaff until I "feel like someone is helping me", perhaps
